{"3713750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dystopicon", "steam_appid": 3713750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.avif?t=1788275121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.webp?t=1788275121 width=1560 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in a dystopian society </strong>where your job is to<strong> watch TV to earn money and purchase services </strong>to satisfy your needs.<strong> Investigate</strong> your surroundings and choose whether to<strong> be a good citizen—or rebel. </strong>But remember: curiosity comes at a high price in this<strong> dystopian time management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.poster.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.webm?t=1788275121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.mp4?t=1788275121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of Class-2 citizens, rewarded with a small apartment and a very simple job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch television.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a paycheck based on the channels you watch, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your money on various services to make life more comfortable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Investigate hidden objects or stories</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Collaborate  with the dissidents and rebel</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/83daaf647fddabb0e907e1c59b58327d.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through daily government broadcasts, citizens will be informed about the evolution of society and receive new items to spend their earnings on. They can enjoy a comfortable existence—or risk breaking the rules and facing the consequences. But who ever said knowledge was free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/570f5c8ec90f201e4cc74101ccb708cd.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopicon</strong> is a game inspired by literary classics like <i>1984</i>, <i>Brave new world</i>, <i>Ubik</i>, and the video game <i>Papers, please</i>. Tells its story through gameplay, written messages, and comic-style sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cb43d30cd623dc755b0a226682f9af7d.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cfe5e1eaf2dfccbdf215fbc1ff79fafd.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/2f103a053d4ab8df3ac227cf4671373a.avif?t=1788275121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/2f103a053d4ab8df3ac227cf4671373a.avif?t=1788275121 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.avif?t=1788275121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.webp?t=1788275121 width=1560 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in a dystopian society </strong>where your job is to<strong> watch TV to earn money and purchase services </strong>to satisfy your needs.<strong> Investigate</strong> your surroundings and choose whether to<strong> be a good citizen—or rebel. </strong>But remember: curiosity comes at a high price in this<strong> dystopian time management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.poster.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.webm?t=1788275121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.mp4?t=1788275121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of Class-2 citizens, rewarded with a small apartment and a very simple job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch television.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a paycheck based on the channels you watch, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your money on various services to make life more comfortable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Investigate hidden objects or stories</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Collaborate  with the dissidents and rebel</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/83daaf647fddabb0e907e1c59b58327d.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through daily government broadcasts, citizens will be informed about the evolution of society and receive new items to spend their earnings on. They can enjoy a comfortable existence—or risk breaking the rules and facing the consequences. But who ever said knowledge was free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/570f5c8ec90f201e4cc74101ccb708cd.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopicon</strong> is a game inspired by literary classics like <i>1984</i>, <i>Brave new world</i>, <i>Ubik</i>, and the video game <i>Papers, please</i>. Tells its story through gameplay, written messages, and comic-style sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cb43d30cd623dc755b0a226682f9af7d.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cfe5e1eaf2dfccbdf215fbc1ff79fafd.avif?t=1788275121\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/2f103a053d4ab8df3ac227cf4671373a.avif?t=1788275121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/2f103a053d4ab8df3ac227cf4671373a.avif?t=1788275121 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An uncomfortable dystopian time-management game where your job is watching TV to earn money and buy services to survive after robots replace humans at work. Choose to be a good citizen or a rebel. But beware! Curiosity has a price in this dystopian life simulator.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Have you seen how few resources are needed to talk about capitalism, technological isolationism and the extreme individualization of a society in which communities are lacking?”<br>Nivel Oculto<br><br>“It’s an interesting little game with multi